  "_provenance": "Written by scripts/a0-vectors/gen-ata-vectors.mjs from @solana/web3.js findProgramAddressSync / isOnCurve, @noble/curves ed25519 and @scure/base, after recomputing the program side's pool, tree and relayer-fee-ATA addresses. No Rust output is read. Rerun: node scripts/a0-vectors/gen-ata-vectors.mjs [--check] [--spl-token=<dir>].",
